Key Takeaway for Future Challenges
When you see assembly dumps:
Ignore setup/teardown noise (push/pop rbp, endbr64)
Ignore argument storage (mov ... edi, mov ... rsi) unless the question asks about arguments
Focus on the register the question asks about
mov eax, <value> is almost always the answer when the question is about return values
